{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_05",
  "title": "God in His Temple",
  "storyCode": "HE-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c0f3b7b9d5d254e0c19bdc872e96dfb161124094695253fff081cabfa3010cf6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "You're accusing me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "That's not what I meant..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "What about you? Are you going to accuse me too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "text": "Come now, Raimund, no one's making any accusations..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "I didn't start any fires."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "Then why are you here at this hour?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "You don't pray with us. You don't come to the sacrarium. You... you people don't have any faith!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "We may not have faith. But that doesn't mean we have anything to do with the fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "I had some personal business that took me past this place. Believe me or don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "What sort of business?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Nothing to do with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "Hey...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fernand",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "text": "Enough. Is there some rule against us being here? You just want to accuse us of starting the fire, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fernand",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "text": "We shouldn't have helped them fight the fire. We should have let the place burn to the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anxious Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "text": "What did you say?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "text": "Fires have happened before, at this time of year. It could just be a coincidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "What a coincidence it would be! You there, didn't you say someone started the fire? Come here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Yes, I believe this was an intentional act."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "And you think I did it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "No, I don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "You're lying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I have no reason to lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "The fire spread quickly. It can be inferred that the arsonist was near the sacrarium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "And Raimund was—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Do not jump to conclusions. What I meant was that anyone who was near the scene is a suspect."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "That includes all of you, and myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "Wh-What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "text": "You think we started the fire? We're Sankta. Why would we burn our own sacrarium?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Race is not proof of innocence. I would not hesitate to destroy the sacrarium, if I thought it necessary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Calm Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I did not find any evidence implicating this Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fernand",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "text": "Hmph, at least you're talking sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "text": "Senior Federico is right... we can't accuse anybody without evidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "You're gonna just let this go?! It's the sacrarium! And all those flowers that you so painstakingly grew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "text": "Please, that's enough!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clément",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "text": "I don't want to suspect any of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "Clément..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "The arguing must stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "The possibility of the Sankta burning their own sacrarium cannot be eliminated. I will continue to investigate until I discover the true culprit."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Hey, wing-man, about what just happened..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "You're the one who started all that, alright? You're the one who first said that someone started the fire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "And you don't fully trust me, do you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Can you give me a little more than that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Ahem. Anyway, what I mean is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "...Don't expect me to thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "(He doesn't know how to say gratias, Sara.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "(Poor thing...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "(We can teach him! It's not hard.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "(But I'm a little scared of him...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Who are you saying doesn't know how to say gratias?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Hey, wing-man! Where did these kids come from? I've never seen them before!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Eek!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "You don't know them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Should I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Very good. I want to ask you about the Sarkaz population here, and about these two children."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "What? You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "I'll answer your questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Gerald! The fire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "I saw it all. You did well, Raimund."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "And... we meet again, Reverend Executor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I don't understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "You were standing there for a long time. I thought you didn't intend to show your face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Guess there's no hiding from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Why did you change your mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I believed you did not want to see me again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Peace makes one timid."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Would you like to pay a visit to our place, Executor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "We don't have much, but there's a place to sit down, and you can see with your own eyes how the Sarkaz live here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "As for your questions... I'll do my best to answer them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I haven't been so active in a long time. I've never been good at pursuit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "However..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I've got you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "(Bizarre cry)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Quiet. This is a residential area. You'll bother the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "(Growls)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "Eat... hungry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Oh, you can talk? This will be much easier if we can communicate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "(Strange roar)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I guess it's not that simple."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I'm sorry, but you'll have to stay put. It's dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I'll contact the Iberian Inquisition. I'm sure they know more about you than I would. If you're really sapient, maybe you can talk to their priests..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Who's that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Stop right there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I must ask you to stay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The night is cut open by a pulse of light.\nLemuen feels a heavy weight that forces her gun down.\nThe shadow that wields the light stands silently, drawing back the exotic sword before the gun that is slowly pointing towards him.\nAs the clouds disperse to reveal the moon, Lemuen begins to see who it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Well, there have been a lot of unwelcome visitors today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Can I ask you to stop bothering me? I will be very, very angry if someone gets hurt because we wasted too much time here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I'm afraid I cannot give way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I must ask you not to stop that pitiful soul."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "A noise. Source unclear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "You don't have a lot of people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "More than you think. Some went out and haven't returned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "It's getting late. Go back and have some rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Sarkaz Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "text": "Are you sure we're leaving tomorrow? Some people haven't come back yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "We follow the plan as it is. We set out tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Sarkaz Inhabitant",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Senior Federico."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "I'm sleepy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "I'm sleepy, and hungry too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Are you gonna take us home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "I want to go home... I want Mamma..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Have gone all day without food?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Mamma never eats. She says she's not hungry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "But we haven't eaten today. My tummy hurts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "It's so weird."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "It's not weird. Food is one of the body's basic needs, and being deprived of it leads to discomfort and pain."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Mmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "That's so complicated!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Is it normal to feel pain if you don't eat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Has Mamma been hurting when she doesn't eat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "If what you say is true, yes, your mother has been suffering physical torment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Enough, Reverend Executor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "This is a fact."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "...*sob*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Waaaaaahhh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Uwaaaahh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Sometimes, the truth is better left unsaid."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "*sniffles*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Is Mamma hurting now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I cannot confirm your mother's current status."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Executor kneels down. No one pays attention to the dirt on the edge of his robe, and the adornments that represent his status.\nFederico Giallo gazes straight into the children's eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I am here as an executor of the Notarial Hall to investigate the truth of what is happening here at the monastery, and to maintain its peace and order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "The disappearance of an inhabitant is within the scope of my mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Do you mean...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "You'll help us find Mamma?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Yes, I will find your mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara & Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Yay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "I never would've thought..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Will you leave these children in my care for now, Reverend Executor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I cannot make the decision for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Will you go with this young man over here, children?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "But I have to... well, I guess I can do it, now that the sacrarium's all burned up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "(It's the one even scarier than Senior Federico.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "(Yeah, he's so scary...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "You two..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "That will do, Raimund."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "He'll take you kids to supper, then it's off to bed, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "But I want to stay with Senior Federico..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Sara, Federico's busy! We need to be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "O-Okay, we'll go with the scary guy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Hahaha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Boss!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "A-Ahem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Can you get the kids something to eat, then put them to bed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "I can... but where do I take them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Hyman's house."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Hyman's? I guess there's nobody there right now... but what if Hyman comes back tonight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "It'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Alright, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "See you tomorrow, Senior Federico!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "I hope we find Mamma tomorrow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "I will come for you in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Erendel",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "text": "Yay! Good night, Senior Federico."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Senior Federico, Senior Federico..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "I-I can't reach you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Come down a little lower!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "Hehe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Estara",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "text": "G-Good night!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gerald",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "text": "Quite the lady's man, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Kids these days... what's so great about that guy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raimund",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "text": "Hey, wait up, you two! Don't run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "...Good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I thought this was going to be an easy trip, almost like a vacation, welcoming some brethren back to Laterano. It didn't sound hard at all, did it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Well, I guess I did have to deal with Oren."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "But that wasn't too much of a problem. It's not like you can't talk to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Certainly, your skills with a gun can solve many problems."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Not quite enough to deal with you, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "You flatter me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I'm not flattering you... should I call you Father?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "You came to protect that... curious visitor of ours, didn't you? I suppose you're from Iberia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "You wear a cleric's robe, but you feel completely different to believers of the Lateran faith."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "You're sharp."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Honest, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I won't beat around the bush, then. I don't normally like to be so direct, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Not one more step forward. Leave, now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "You are not fit to set foot in Paradise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I'm afraid I can't comply."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I am needed here, for a little longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "(Tough customer.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "(An unusual sword. The style is Iberian...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Your attacks are even sharper than your words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I still harbor hope for mutual understanding, but I concede that you're acting appropriately, given your position."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I'm curious, though... how do you define Paradise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "A place where everyone lives in peace and happiness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Preferably with less unwelcome visitors."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Would you call this place Paradise, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "You're enjoying this chit-chat, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "A group of people have found peace away from the world for sixty years. What do you call this, if not Paradise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Even if their lives are endless cold, hunger and suffering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "They may be wanting for material comforts... but it's far from endless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Ah, yes. Laterano will bring salvation. The hard days will soon come to an end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "At the price of abandoning some."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "...This isn't anyone's fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Please, don't get me wrong. I'm not accusing anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "But I've been thinking: What is the difference between us? Is it physical, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "From the individual's very birth, all that makes us who we are causes our thinking to go in divergent ways and reach divergent conclusions..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "Is there really such a thing as mutual understanding within this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Are you really going to ask this to a Sankta?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "You could try it yourself in your next life, if you happen to become a Sankta."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "...*cough*!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "(This has taken too long. Can't let that thing attack the residents.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "(I need to take care of this quickly...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "No need to be anxious. I don't really plan on doing anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I'm here because my kin need help."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You sound sincere, but I'm not in a position to trust you.\n*cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "*sigh*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "You're as stubborn as a former student of mine. It can be a virtue, but it can also be trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I'm curious about a student who could cause you trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "One of the best I've ever had. We never saw each other again, after he left Iberia."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I didn't want to do this... I'm <i>so</i> getting in trouble for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Negotiations failed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Can't say I regret it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lemuen movement is as light as her voice.\nShe pushes away the movement-aiding device beneath her. The lamp that hung on the handle sways in the night wind, falls, then shatters.\nLight leaks out haphazardly, splashing on the silhouette slowly standing up in front.\nThe dark veil of night is lifted."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "You can stand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Not yet, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Rehabilitation is going to get longer, and I'm going to get scolded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "*hiss*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aulus",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_941_1",
      "text": "I trust you won't push yourself too hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You're not in good physical shape, nor are you used to this kind of battle—\nOh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Thanks for the compliment. That was aimed for your mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "The people tune out the sermon, when it gets too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "Especially if they're already fuming after a long and not very good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I think I can justify my response based on the provocation."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cardinal aide narrows her eyes. The facade of meekness that built up from years of being bedridden falls apart in the sound of her gun being loaded.\nLemuen's light laugh has no warmth in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I'm tired. Let's do this quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "I'll say it again—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "—Get out of my way, Father."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "text": "You may not set foot in Paradise."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "Hungry... so hungry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "Eat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The thin door plank is pushed open from the outside.\nThe children are still sleeping.\nThe cold wind pours into the tiny, battered house through the gap. The unknown threat sneaks in soundlessly, and slowly approaches..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "Eat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "Hungry... eat, eat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Twisted Monster",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "text": "Oh... oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
